{"content_hash": "b4f23fa2d53ebdf9", "version_id": 1064, "article_id": 109, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "Cozy gardening sim Green New Life launches on Steam December 7", "title_zh": "舒适园艺模拟游戏《绿色新生》将于12月7日在Steam上线", "has_translation": true, "topic": "culture", "source": "gcores", "source_url": "https://www.gcores.com/articles/222792", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1789370902773-b8dcdcf4b4ca?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Mnx8Y2FsbSUyMGdhbWUlMjBncmVlbnxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzk1NjY0NTcyfDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by panpan ma on Unsplash", "author": "panpan ma", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@mymphoebe?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/people-relaxing-in-mengyang-park-O8VETz13QlA?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(180, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(218, 46%, 48%)", "label": "CULTURE", "seed": "dd7cc7a7ba8d"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-26", "word_count": 173, "reading_minutes": 0.9, "lead": "Publisher Gamirror Games has announced that Green New Life, a healing gardening simulation developed by Positive Impact Games, will be released on Steam on December 7. The game invites players to plant seeds, meet ancient spirits, and restore a barren world.", "lead_zh": "发行商Gamirror Games宣布，由Positive Impact Games开发的治愈系园艺模拟游戏《绿色新生》将于12月7日在Steam平台发售。游戏邀请玩家播下种子、邂逅古老精灵，并让荒芜的世界重焕生机。", "preview": "Set in a warm folk tale, Green New Life is a cozy simulation about healing the world. Players restore habitats, befriend nature spirits, and", "preview_zh": "《绿色新生》以温暖的民间传说为背景，是一款关于治愈世界的舒适模拟游戏。玩家修复栖息地，与自然精灵交朋友，让荒原重获生机。他们用双手、用心，再加上一点魔法，看着种子长成大树，沙漠变成绿洲。暖风吹过新生的草地，青蛙回到湿地，雨水终于落下。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 1047, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/109/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 67.5, "size_bytes": 405936, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 203, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@c391479e/content/data/versions/1064.json", "paragraphs": ["Set in a warm folk tale, Green New Life is a cozy simulation about healing the world. Players restore habitats, befriend nature spirits, and bring wasteland back to life. Using their hands, their heart, and a little magic, they watch seeds grow into trees and deserts turn into oases. Warm winds sweep over new grass, frogs return to wetlands, and rain finally falls.", "The game is designed for casual players who want a stress-free experience. There are no countdowns or time pressure, so players can restore the land at their own pace. Visible ecological recovery shows the impact of every action, while adaptive background music and ASMR-level nature sounds make wind, rain, and water part of the journey.", "Its intuitive gameplay is combined with local folklore, introducing players to a unique and mysterious natural world. Since a demo launched in October, the game has received a 'Very Positive' rating on Steam, with 89% of reviews positive, and it has gathered more than 50,000 wishlists. On December 7, players can join the green revival."], "paragraphs_zh": ["《绿色新生》以温暖的民间传说为背景，是一款关于治愈世界的舒适模拟游戏。玩家修复栖息地，与自然精灵交朋友，让荒原重获生机。他们用双手、用心，再加上一点魔法，看着种子长成大树，沙漠变成绿洲。暖风吹过新生的草地，青蛙回到湿地，雨水终于落下。", "这款游戏专为想要无压力体验的休闲玩家设计。游戏没有倒计时，也没有时间压力，玩家可以按自己的节奏修复土地。可见的生态恢复展现了每一个行动的影响，而自适应背景音乐和ASMR级别的自然音效让风声、雨声和水声成为旅程的一部分。", "直观的玩法结合了当地民间传说，向玩家介绍一个独特而神秘的自然世界。自10月推出试玩版以来，游戏在Steam上获得“特别好评”，89%的评价为正面，并已积累超过5万个愿望单。12月7日，玩家可以加入这场绿色复兴。"], "body": "Set in a warm folk tale, Green New Life is a cozy simulation about healing the world. Players restore habitats, befriend nature spirits, and bring wasteland back to life. Using their hands, their heart, and a little magic, they watch seeds grow into trees and deserts turn into oases. Warm winds sweep over new grass, frogs return to wetlands, and rain finally falls.\n\nThe game is designed for casual players who want a stress-free experience. There are no countdowns or time pressure, so players can restore the land at their own pace. Visible ecological recovery shows the impact of every action, while adaptive background music and ASMR-level nature sounds make wind, rain, and water part of the journey.\n\nIts intuitive gameplay is combined with local folklore, introducing players to a unique and mysterious natural world. Since a demo launched in October, the game has received a 'Very Positive' rating on Steam, with 89% of reviews positive, and it has gathered more than 50,000 wishlists. On December 7, players can join the green revival.", "body_zh": "《绿色新生》以温暖的民间传说为背景，是一款关于治愈世界的舒适模拟游戏。玩家修复栖息地，与自然精灵交朋友，让荒原重获生机。他们用双手、用心，再加上一点魔法，看着种子长成大树，沙漠变成绿洲。暖风吹过新生的草地，青蛙回到湿地，雨水终于落下。\n\n这款游戏专为想要无压力体验的休闲玩家设计。游戏没有倒计时，也没有时间压力，玩家可以按自己的节奏修复土地。可见的生态恢复展现了每一个行动的影响，而自适应背景音乐和ASMR级别的自然音效让风声、雨声和水声成为旅程的一部分。\n\n直观的玩法结合了当地民间传说，向玩家介绍一个独特而神秘的自然世界。自10月推出试玩版以来，游戏在Steam上获得“特别好评”，89%的评价为正面，并已积累超过5万个愿望单。12月7日，玩家可以加入这场绿色复兴。", "text": "Set in a warm folk tale, Green New Life is a cozy simulation about healing the world. Players restore habitats, befriend nature spirits, and bring wasteland back to life. Using their hands, their heart, and a little magic, they watch seeds grow into trees and deserts turn into oases. Warm winds sweep over new grass, frogs return to wetlands, and rain finally falls. The game is designed for casual players who want a stress-free experience. There are no countdowns or time pressure, so players can restore the land at their own pace. Visible ecological recovery shows the impact of every action, while adaptive background music and ASMR-level nature sounds make wind, rain, and water part of the journey. Its intuitive gameplay is combined with local folklore, introducing players to a unique and mysterious natural world. Since a demo launched in October, the game has received a 'Very Positive' rating on Steam, with 89% of reviews positive, and it has gathered more than 50,000 wishlists. On December 7, players can join the green revival.", "vocab": [{"word": "simulation", "pos": "noun", "zh": "模拟", "note": "often used for games that imitate real activities", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "healing", "pos": "adj", "zh": "治愈的", "note": "describes something that makes you feel calm and relaxed", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "habitat", "pos": "noun", "zh": "栖息地", "note": "the natural home of plants or animals", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "barren", "pos": "adj", "zh": "贫瘠的", "note": "land that is too poor for plants to grow", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "wasteland", "pos": "noun", "zh": "荒地", "note": "an empty area of land that is not used or cared for", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "oasis", "pos": "noun", "zh": "绿洲", "note": "a fertile spot in a desert where water is found", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "countdown", "pos": "noun", "zh": "倒计时", "note": "a timer that counts backwards to zero", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "adaptive", "pos": "adj", "zh": "自适应的", "note": "able to change to suit different conditions", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "intuitive", "pos": "adj", "zh": "直观的", "note": "easy to understand without instruction", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "folklore", "pos": "noun", "zh": "民间传说", "note": "traditional stories and beliefs of a community", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "wishlist", "pos": "noun", "zh": "愿望单", "note": "a list of games a user wants to buy", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "revival", "pos": "noun", "zh": "复兴", "note": "the process of becoming active or healthy again", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-26T03:42:27.570696", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Set", "s": 0.3, "e": 0.487, "sm": 300, "em": 487, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "in", "s": 0.487, "e": 0.562, "sm": 487, "em": 562, "cs": 4, "ce": 6, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "a", "s": 0.562, "e": 0.662